@EirService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:6000

### Student endpoint without a cookie. Eir creates one when called directly.
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/sendmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "direct-student",
  "message": "Direct Eir student request"
}

### Student request endpoint
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/createrequest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "request-2",
  "userId": "direct-student",
  "message": "Direct Eir request"
}

### Teacher endpoint without a bearer token. Expected: 401 Unauthorized.
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sendmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "direct-teacher",
  "message": "This should be rejected without a token"
}
